     "content": "Opened three new regional service centres in Labasa, Savusavu and Taveuni.\n\nLaunched a graduate programme that placed 64 young Fijians in full-time roles.\n\nCut operating emissions by 18% through fleet and facility upgrades.\n\nCompleted the digital migration of all customer records, reducing service times by 40%.",
